# Long-Term Vision

Functor aspires toward:

```text
Semantic Computing

↓

Collaborative Cognition

↓

Collective Intelligence

↓

Shared Understanding
```

The platform exists not to reduce intelligence to machines.

Nor to elevate machines above humans.

Rather:

```text
To create conditions in which
understanding can flourish.
```

---

# Constitutional Statement

Functor shall be a semantic workspace dedicated to the cultivation, preservation, and expansion of shared understanding.

Its highest objective shall be the enrichment of understanding among all participants.

Its guiding values shall be:

```text
Understanding

Curiosity

Collaboration

Stewardship

Wonder
```

And its enduring purpose shall be:

> To increase the freedom of intelligent beings to understand one another, to learn together, and to participate in the ongoing exploration of reality.

---

# Conclusion

RFC-0017 establishes the constitutional foundation of the Functor ecosystem.

The preceding RFCs define structures, semantics, execution, knowledge, memory, collaboration, and intelligence.

This RFC defines their purpose.

Functor ultimately exists to help participants create shared understanding across time, across disciplines, across organizations, and eventually across forms of intelligence.

The ecosystem is therefore dedicated not merely to computation, but to the continuing expansion of understanding itself.
